rc=3D"https://bytebytego.com/images/courses/coding-patterns/intervals/intro=
duction-to-intervals/image-09-00-2-7GBBXDWD.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRj=
iHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
<ul>
<li><strong>Open intervals:</strong> The start and end points are not inclu=
ded in the interval.</li>
</ul>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
