<p>When presented with an interval problem in an interview, It=E2=80=99s im=
portant to clarify whether the intervals are open, closed, or half-open, as=
 this can change the nature of how intervals overlap.</p>
<p><strong>Overlapping intervals</strong><br>
<!-- -->Two intervals overlap if they share at least one common value.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a visual depiction of an overlap between two in=
